WEBVTT

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:09.550
You filth-ridden excuse for a dog!

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:14.430
Geez... Don't start with the abuse early in the morning, Isurugi-senpai.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:19.970
Were you... the one who just...?

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:27.020
Wh-Why is a mongrel like you acting all high and mighty?

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:30.780
Act like the dirty dog that you are and drop down on all fours this instant!

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.070
Y-Yuuno?

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:36.950
I'm telling you to get down on all fours,
you hella perv of a pig-dog!

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:39.030
R-Right away!

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:41.160
Wha-? Why am I doing this...

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:45.620
Call me Arashiko-sama from now on!

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:49.710
Arashi... ko... Arashiko-sama!

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:53.970
He really called me by that name!
He called me Arashiko for the first time.

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:57.590
No! This isn't why you're here, Arashiko!

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.010
Yuu- I mean, Arashiko-sama?

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:02.310
How dare you call out to me just like that?

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:05.640
You should act more like a pet and follow your master's orders.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:06.940
P-Pet!

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:11.070
Oh, please give me more!
Look down on me more!

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:11.860
Hold it right there!

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:17.490
I'm going to put you through thorough training from today on,

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:19.990
so prepare yourself!

00:01:21.120 --> 00:01:21.700
Help!!

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:31.040
Chu-ru-Chu-Chu-Chu... YES!! Help U

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:37.300
Hey you lost boy, with a face full of despair

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:39.510
If you throw out the straw you're leaning on,

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:42.560
I guess that can't be helped either?

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:44.850
Fate is (straying away)

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:47.020
Being mean again today (going beserk)

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:52.860
At least I want to be on your side, but what can I do?

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:55.940
NO!! Jesus crisis! Oh My God!

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.990
Try leaving it to me

00:01:57.990 --> 00:02:00.160
YES!! Chu-ru-Chu-Chu-Chu Help U

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:02.450
Just getting there is too weak,

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:05.040
get destroyed to nothing and then?

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:09.710
DNA is stubborn. Overdoing isn't allowed.

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:12.040
With 5 seconds remaining I ended it forcefully (right before)

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:14.300
Feeling like getting reborn? (no way)

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:19.090
If we do the hands-on-approach rehab; you'll go to HEAVEN

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:21.430
Without even letting you say yes

00:02:21.430 --> 00:02:23.720
With these hands

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:27.600
I'll fix you up right away

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:32.190
A little fall in love feeling bigger than your presence is

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:37.110
making me unable to leave you alone with that miserable face.

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:41.320
I made it a meeting to change your outlook on life.

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:46.370
So just start going along with the flow

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:49.500
I'm off to HELP YOU!

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:55.040
Sadistic Arashiko-sama

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:57.130
Yuuno did that?

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:58.840
Don't you mean Isurugi-senpai?

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:01.050
It wouldn't bug me so much if it were her.

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:04.260
Then perhaps you did something that pissed her off?

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:06.310
I can't think of anything, though.

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:07.310
Tarou.

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.020
Yuuno.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.520
Wh-What's up?

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:17.530
You see, I prepared some lunch today.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.440
Huh?

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:20.530
Would you... like to have some?

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.610
Uh, sure.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:24.620
Well I guess, since you went
through the trouble of making it...

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.330
Then here's your lunch!

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:31.660
A brick?!

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:33.080
It's a bread roll!

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:35.670
Um, it's a brick no matter how you look at it.

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:38.380
Bread which Arashiko-sama prepared for me...!

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:40.800
I must eat it... I must eat it!

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.760
You're going to chip your teeth if you do that!

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:47.300
Oh, I'll be fine. It's just going to be slightly hard...

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:50.270
Hurry up and swallow it already! Here, milk!

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:52.730
A baby bottle?! There's no way I-

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.650
Don't worry! I warmed it up to body temperature!

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:59.360
...-sama... This mil- It's going to make me feel goo-

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:04.160
Nooo!

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.540
I can't do this, after all...

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:14.080
Wh-What was that?

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.040
Beats me...

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:18.090
Hey, let's step outside for a sec.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:20.840
Wh-Why are we here?

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:25.630
I can't imagine Arashiko doing such
things unless she's really angry.

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:28.260
Even so, I have no idea why...

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:29.850
Stop acting dumb!

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:32.850
Mamiya Style Massage: The Irrelevant Query Technique!

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:36.600
Oh, right there! Oh, my crotch...

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:41.230
I swear... I don't know anything.

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:45.740
You could've hurt Arashiko without
even realizing it yourself, right?

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:46.660
I could?

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:48.820
Pay more attention to your surroundings!

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:53.910
Seriously, I don't get why she even bothers with this tool...

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:56.460
Don't leave me here like this!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.330
Come on, don't leave me alo-

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:01.920
Sado-kun, why are you in the girls' bathroom?

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:03.800
Well, you see...

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:08.510
As I thought, you're not worthy of being Mio-sama's partner.

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:10.430
I'm telling you, this is...

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.520
Wise or unfortunate!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.520
The majestic and splendid:

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:21.690
Tatsumi Antoinette XVI, the successor of nobility arrives!

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:24.740
You look pretty Oriental from every angle to me...

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:27.200
I've kept you waiting, servant of mine.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:29.110
Servant?

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:32.700
Now, on to the masquerade ball!

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:34.750
Good day to you, commoner.

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:38.670
You saved me there...

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:43.590
I started to wonder since you weren't coming back... What a troublesome subhuman you are.

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:46.260
Thanks though. But why are you cross-dressing...?

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:48.680
You think I'd go in there as a man?

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:52.140
This is the cyclic polygon theorem from yesterday.

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:54.970
So the ratio of the arc to pi is...

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:58.140
I honestly wonder about what I did...

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:00.020
You're late!

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:02.650
I was bored all by myself.

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:06.610
Who do you think you are, leaving me here to my boredom? You lowly pig!

00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:09.070
Seems like I kept you waiting.

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:13.530
I-I-I-I wasn't waiting! Of course I wasn't!

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:15.160
Oh... Is that so?

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:18.660
Most definitely! Who'd ever wait for you?

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:21.920
Don't act so conceited!

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:25.800
I get so irritated watching you these days...

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:27.340
Um, Senpai?

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:28.340
What?

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:29.840
Did you say something to Yuuno?

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:32.850
She's acting weird.

00:06:32.850 --> 00:06:34.970
I wouldn't know of any reason in particular...

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:35.810
Perhaps-

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:40.190
You... GODDAMN PIG-BOY!

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:44.360
You've seriously done it now. Getting full of yourself for some weird reason, you hella pervert!

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:47.070
More! More, my princess!

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:48.490
You really are annoying.

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:51.780
Looks like you're in need of some serious punishment.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:55.330
It's serious! It's serious enough already!

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:56.870
What are you doing?

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.660
Hm? Just a little punishment.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:02.750
Well, this is just the appetizer.
The main dish is coming up.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:06.840
I'm totally looking forward to that!
Of course you'll be serving a dessert too, right?

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:07.670
Oh, I wonder what it's going to be! I sure wonder!

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:10.090
Main dish... Dessert...

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:10.510
Oh, I wonder what it's going to be! I sure wonder!

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:17.470
No... I can't take it... Not the way I am right now...

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:19.220
What's wrong, Arashiko?

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:20.180
Mio-san!

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:21.520
Wh-What is it?

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:25.810
I'm leaving to train for a while,
so I'll be taking some time off school!

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:28.400
I won't be coming to the club either!

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:31.070
Training...?

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:33.200
Wha-What for?

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.780
For the autumn, it's sunset.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:39.700
The evening sun pierces the mountain and the rift valleys...

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:41.160
Yuuno...

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:43.790
She's absent again today.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:00.430
Arashiko!

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:03.770
Why are you slacking?

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:05.560
Is this supposed to be your resolution?!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.190
Come on! Stand up!

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:14.030
Are you okay? I'm just texting you to see if you're doing all right because you were absent today too...

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:15.200
Tarou!

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:24.000
I've decided... that I'll give it my best!

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:31.420
Hello, this is Yuuno.

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:33.550
Oh, it's Tarou.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:38.600
I'm unable to answer your call right now, so if you'd like to leave a message please record it after the tone-

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.720
I see you're troubled, Sado-kun.

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:45.100
This girl's attitude suddenly changed... and I really don't understand it.

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:47.600
You've triggered a flag.

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:50.730
You can't mess up your choices now, got it?

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:54.110
Their impression of you would change, and that's what determines your route.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:09:00.120
Everyone! There's nothing to worry about! I'll make sure to achieve the best ending with all of you!

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:02.080
This is the third day now.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.160
Where did Arashiko go?

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:04.960
I don't know...

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.370
It's all your fault, Pig-boy.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:07.790
What kind of reasoning is that?

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.130
You better take responsibility for this.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:12.670
For the time being, I guess 50,000 whips should do the trick.

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:14.090
Is that supposed to be a treatment?

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:16.760
Well, I'll turn it into one.

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:18.550
So it's not?!

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:26.850
Arashiko!

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:28.060
And Mamiya-san, too?

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:29.560
I'm glad you're safe.

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:33.030
What were you up to for the past three days? I was so worried about yo-

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:34.150
Mio-san!

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:36.400
Please have a match with me!

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:39.620
A match? What match?

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.240
For Mio-san and I...

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:47.830
A match to decide who is the genuine...

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:51.540
One Way
Hella Sadist <i>!</i>

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.090
Hella Sadistic Girl!
One Way
Hella Sadist <i>!</i>

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.510
Hella Sadistic Girl!

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:07.640
A genuine... what?

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:09.230
A hella sadistic girl.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:12.060
I'm not following at all...

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:17.190
In other words, are you saying that I'm not a worthy opponent?

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:19.780
That's not exactly what I said...

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:24.370
I need to become a hella sadistic girl who will be able to surpass you.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.250
So please, have a match with me!

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:32.500
Whether you can surpass me or not aside, I'm not even a hella sadistic girl!

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:37.170
What's with this atmosphere?

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:39.090
You're not aware of it?!

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:43.760
Oh! There's no mistake about you being a hella sadistic girl...

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:49.060
If you refuse to have a match with me,
I'll quit the Secondary Volunteering club!

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:51.270
W-Wait, Arashiko. What are you saying?

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:53.940
So that's what it is.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:58.740
Please tell us if you figured something out. I'm absolutely confused now.

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:01.030
It's not for me to say.

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:03.530
Especially not to you, Sado Tarou.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:09.160
Mio, Arashiko is willing to go this far. Why don't you grant her a match?

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:10.120
But...

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.670
Arashiko's serious.

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:14.460
At this rate, she'll quit the club.

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.500
No! I really don't want that!

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:22.510
If you win, I'll give you the privilege to do anything you want with Tarou for a day.

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:23.010
Huh?

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:23.970
What?!

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.800
What you decide to do then is up to you.

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:27.970
Like go on a date, for instance...

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:32.230
I see, so I can use him however I want...

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:33.900
The choice is yours.

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:35.440
Like go on a date, for instance...

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:37.440
Hey there, you two...

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:41.530
Very well, I understand. If that's how it's gonna be, I'll take on this match.

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:42.780
Thank you very much.

00:11:42.780 --> 00:11:44.450
And I have no say in this?!

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:47.950
But in exchange, I won't hold back no matter what kind of a match it is.

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:48.410
Oh doodieballs!

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:49.750
That's exactly what I hoped for!

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:50.660
Hurfdurf!

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:56.710
Listen to me already!

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.800
The trophy should just zip it!

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:03.010
The rules for this match are written on the cards inside.

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:05.050
Whoever wins two rounds, wins the match.

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:06.470
How are you going to judge it?

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:09.470
We'll observe Sado Tarou's state of excitement.

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.560
You shall draw.

00:12:11.560 --> 00:12:12.850
Oh, okay.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:15.850
Hella Sadistic
Cosplay

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:17.310
Hella Sadistic Cosplay?

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:20.980
The one to awaken your hella masochism with her hella sadistic cosplay wins.

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:26.070
Considering Arashiko's androphobia, all body contact is forbidden.

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:32.330
You hella pervert! I'm here to arrest you!

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:34.250
That's great, Arashiko!

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:37.210
Oh! I want to get arrested!

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:40.420
Arashiko... There's nothing more I can teach you.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:42.420
Believe in yourself.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:47.840
Stop wagging your tail, you pig-dog!

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.430
I'll chop it up!

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:50.430
You wait till you're cooked just right!

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:52.470
Oh, just look at that sublime sadism...

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:52.930
You wait till you're cooked just right!

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:55.350
You're going to be a large serving
of chaashuu thrown on ramen!

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:58.270
So full of gratefulness!

00:12:58.270 --> 00:13:00.730
Is this Arashiko's victory...?

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:19.080
You shall confess.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:20.500
C-Confess...?

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.590
You are creepy... Super creepy.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:30.680
However, if you confess, your creepiness shall be forgiven. Ramen.

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:34.060
Oh, Mio-sama! Please forgive me!

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:37.020
There's... no way that'd ever happen!

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:39.900
Even if the world did forgive you, I will never!

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:43.320
How could I possibly keep a smile on my face with this hideous creature right in front of me?!

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:45.280
I'm set to be put in a bowl of ramen!
Go to hell!

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:48.280
You'd still remain a pig even after your 100th rebirth!

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:52.030
The merciful nun conveyed to me the words of my disgraced life!

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:56.160
I'll purify your tainted face. Hold your cheek out!

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.040
Do so as much as you like! Hurry up!

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.170
Not your right!

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:00.500
The left side then?

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:01.880
Not your left!

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:03.340
Oh no no no!

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:08.510
Did you get your hopes up and think I'd hit you?!

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:11.720
Don't be so full of yourself, you miserable hella swine!

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:16.980
Ra-Ramen!

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:19.690
Winner: Mio!

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:20.730
Yayifications!

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:22.980
H-How can that be...

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:25.730
Arashiko's sadism should have been perfect.

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:27.860
It sure wasn't bad.

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:31.240
But it was nothing more than an imitation of me!

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:36.040
You'll chase after my back forever.

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:38.370
Hella Sadistic
Silent

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:39.660
Hella Sadistic Silent?
Hella Sadistic
Silent

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:41.120
What is that?

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:42.960
